'''Gardener Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]] increases health, range and freeze duration. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]]. It was added as an unlockable unit in [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] and could be unlocked by playing the Rare Cat Capsule.

