==Trivia==
*Gardener Cat's attack lands at 1f in its cycle, though animation displays it snipping a second time at 6f.
*Gardener Cat, along with [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Vaulter Cat]] and the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]], was one of the first units introduced via an update to The Battle Cats Unite.
*Due to his propensity for attacking with a pair of garden shears, Gardener Cat is possibly a reference to the Scissorman; a recurring main antagonist from the [[wikipedia:Clock Tower (series)|Clock Tower]] series.

